Subject: [PATCH v7 02/12] drm/xe: Allow prefetch-only VM bind IOCTLs to use VM
 read lock
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 14:39:18 -0700
Message-Id: <20260724213928.1670731-3-matthew.brost@intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.34.1
In-Reply-To: <20260724213928.1670731-1-matthew.brost@intel.com>
